      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hell yeah. When i first played I would world hop. But I have fallen in love with a particular avatar, made lots of friends, and started tinkering with avatars in blender and unity. So after a while of just hanging out with friends and testing stuff, I would be out of touch with what worlds are there and find myself either picking worlds I used to visit a lot or just not picking a world. I noticed a random world portal in the hub, but I forget about the hub.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
